<speak>Thank you for leaving the space. I'm just drawing a line under that section in my notebook. The household paperwork has become quite a project in its own right. We have a possible renovation coming up, and suddenly everyone wants a different document in a different format. The contractor has one checklist, the building management has another, and my wife has a sensible list that somehow keeps getting buried under the others. I would like one place where we can find the current version.</speak>